 "text": "Corn Bids - Golden Triangle Energy (GTE)\nSkip to content\nSearch for:\nHome\nProducts Grain Neutral Spirits\nFeed Products\nCorn Bids\nCareers\nMember Info\nCONTACT US\nHome\nProducts Grain Neutral Spirits\nFeed Products\nCorn Bids\nCareers\nMember Info\nCONTACT US\nCorn Bids\nCorn Bids TAYLOR SHARP 2026-09-28T18:55:37+00:00\n-NO Waxy Corn accepted\n– Corn bids may be subject to change without notice.\n– Regular corn receiving hours are Monday through Friday 8:00-4:30\n– Mobile Devices – Scroll Left to Right\nOur Customer Commitment\nGolden Triangle will consistently provide diversified ethanol and feed products that meet or exceed the requirements of our customers, investors and regulatory agencies. We will be actively committed to quality programs that produce steady profit, consistent production and customer satisfaction.\nGetting Started Is Easy!\nContact Us\nContact us and we’ll be in touch to schedule a call to discuss your needs.\nDiscovery Call\nWe’ll introduce ourselves and go over your specific alcohol requirements.\nCustomized Quote\nNow that we’re on the same page, we’ll get you a customized quote.\nCONTACT US\nABOUT US\nOur facility is located in the small town of Craig, in Northwest Missouri. We lie between Omaha and Kansas City, in the heart of corn country.\nAddress: \u000315053 Highway 111\u0003Craig, Missouri 64437\nPhone: 660.683.5646\nOffice Hours: 8:00am – 4:30pm\nLoading Hours: 8:00am – 4:00pm\nOUR LOCATION\n© Copyright 2008 - 2026 | Golden Triangle Energy | All Rights Reserved | Contractor Terms & Conditions\nPage load link\nGo to Top\n× Contact Us\nΔ\nClose",
